<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="905198178"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:07.453"><div begin="0.089" end="0.866" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="0.089" end="0.866" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.089" end="0.509">都是</span><span begin="0.509" end="0.866">你</span></p></div><div begin="24.923" end="47.628" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="24.923" end="29.980" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.923" end="25.490">就像</span><span begin="25.490" end="26.005">早</span><span begin="26.005" end="26.555">就知</span><span begin="26.555" end="27.140">道</span><span begin="27.925" end="29.108">一个故事所有</span><span begin="29.108" end="29.473">情</span><span begin="29.473" end="29.980">节</span></p><p begin="30.805" end="35.574" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.805" end="32.091">却还是会去重</span><span begin="32.091" end="32.854">温一</span><span begin="32.854" end="33.491">遍</span><span begin="33.491" end="34.662">熟悉感</span><span begin="34.662" end="35.574">觉</span></p><p begin="36.789" end="44.202" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.789" end="37.278">我们</span><span begin="37.278" end="37.907">心</span><span begin="37.907" end="38.417">里瞭</span><span begin="38.417" end="39.166">解</span> <span begin="39.882" end="40.212">这出</span><span begin="40.212" end="40.804">戏</span><span begin="40.804" end="40.982">不</span><span begin="40.982" end="41.689">该</span><span begin="41.689" end="42.146">再</span><span begin="42.146" end="44.202">接</span></p><p begin="44.908" end="47.628" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.908" end="46.529">却没有拒</span><span begin="46.529" end="47.628">绝</span></p></div><div begin="47.903" end="1:04.518" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="47.903" end="53.558" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.903" end="48.413">我看</span><span begin="48.413" end="49.193">着</span><span begin="49.193" end="49.504">你</span><span begin="49.504" end="50.256">对</span><span begin="50.256" end="51.288">着空气</span><span begin="51.288" end="52.342">做表</span><span begin="52.342" end="53.558">情</span></p><p begin="53.768" end="59.530" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.768" end="54.338">没有</span><span begin="54.338" end="55.001">对</span><span begin="55.001" end="55.376">手</span><span begin="55.376" end="56.065">的</span><span begin="56.065" end="56.509">戏</span> <span begin="56.509" end="57.229">一场</span><span begin="57.229" end="58.234">又一</span><span begin="58.234" end="59.530">场</span></p><p begin="59.740" end="1:04.518" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.740" end="1:03.143">你只好一个人对镜头</span><span begin="1:03.143" end="1:04.518">笑</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.701" end="1:30.554" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.701" end="1:11.753" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.701" end="1:07.568">如果我真心</span><span begin="1:07.568" end="1:08.343">爱</span><span begin="1:08.343" end="1:08.841">你</span> <span begin="1:09.108" end="1:10.516">该有快乐</span><span begin="1:10.516" end="1:11.244">结</span><span begin="1:11.244" end="1:11.753">局</span></p><p begin="1:11.963" end="1:17.314" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.963" end="1:13.589">怪我不懂</span><span begin="1:13.589" end="1:14.171">珍</span><span begin="1:14.171" end="1:14.963">惜</span> <span begin="1:14.963" end="1:15.477">把</span><span begin="1:15.477" end="1:15.609">你</span><span begin="1:15.609" end="1:15.921">推</span><span begin="1:15.921" end="1:16.180">向</span><span begin="1:16.180" end="1:17.314">他</span></p><p begin="1:17.524" end="1:23.038" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.524" end="1:18.062">我</span><span begin="1:18.062" end="1:18.669">来</span><span begin="1:18.669" end="1:19.048">不</span><span begin="1:19.048" end="1:20.360">及</span><span begin="1:20.539" end="1:20.999">改</span><span begin="1:20.999" end="1:22.019">编结</span><span begin="1:22.019" end="1:23.038">局</span></p><p begin="1:23.048" end="1:30.554" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.048" e